fastverse
---------

The package management code is adapted from the fastverse package
(https://fastverse.org/fastverse/):

  Copyright (C) Sebastian Krantz
  Licence: GPL-3

Adapted files:

  R/animovement.R  -- package documentation and options (fastverse.R)
  R/attach.R       -- attaching, detaching and extending the suite
  R/conflicts.R    -- conflict reporting
  R/update.R       -- animovement_deps(), animovement_update(),
                      animovement_install() and animovement_sitrep()
  R/utils.R        -- package list, project configuration file, version
                      and console styling helpers

The functions animovement_repos(), missing_from_repos_msg(),
deparse_repos() and the installation helpers (.install_packages(),
.install_webr(), .is_webr()) are not from the fastverse.


